{"name":"Japan Blush","hex":"#ddd6f3","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"japan","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A hard black enamel varnish containing asphalt.","Lacquerware."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To varnish (something) with japan.","To ordain (someone)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/japan"},{"term":"blush","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An act of blushing; a pink or red glow on the face caused by embarrassment, shame, shyness, love, etc.","A glow; a flush of colour, especially pink or red."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To become red or pink in the face (and sometimes experience an associated feeling of warmth), especially due to shyness, love, shame, excitement, or embarrassment.","To be shy, ashamed, or embarrassed (to do something)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blush"}],"entries":[{"title":"Blush (Asian band)","blocks":[{"text":"Blush was a Hong Kong–based Asian girl group originally composed of five members from the Philippines, India, China, Japan, and South Korea. They were formed by FarWest Entertainment in 2010 with the intent of popularizing an Asian vocal act in the United States as well as in all of Asia. They perform in the English language and the members currently reside in Los Angeles, California. A reality show called Project Lotus: The Search for Blush about how the band was formed premiered on Channel V on March 8, 2012. They were the first Asian group to have its debut single hit the top 3 on a major US Billboard chart when \"Undivided\" featuring Snoop Dogg reached No. 3 on the Billboard Dance/Play Chart. Their second single, \"Dance On\", reached No. 1 on that chart."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Blush_Band_on_RealTVfilms.jpg/330px-Blush_Band_on_RealTVfilms.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blush_(Asian_band)","wikidata":"Q196696"},{"title":"Japan","blocks":[{"text":"Japan is an island country in East Asia. Located in the Pacific Ocean off the northeast coast of the Asian mainland, it is bordered to the west by the Sea of Japan, the Sea of Okhotsk in the north, and the East China Sea in the south. The Japanese archipelago consists of four major islands alongside over 14,000 smaller islands. Japan is divided into 47 administrative prefectures and eight traditional regions, and around 75% of its terrain is mountainous and heavily forested, concentrating its agriculture and highly urbanized population along its eastern coastal plains. With a population of almost 123 million as of 2026, it is the world's 11th most populous country. Tokyo is the country's capital and largest city."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/9/9e/Flag_of_Japan.svg/330px-Flag_of_Japan.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japan","wikidata":"Q17"},{"title":"Blush (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Blush is a medium bright tone of pink."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Blush_rose_1.jpg/330px-Blush_rose_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blush_(color)","wikidata":"Q22133966"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/9d/Make_You_Blush_album_cover.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/9d/Make_You_Blush_album_cover.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"Make You Blush album cover.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMake_You_Blush_album_cover.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Emperor_Jimmu.jpg/500px-Emperor_Jimmu.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"ht